5.106.m:
Śucismita said:
Eating ash has been observed to increase longevity, O great sage;
tell me if it is capable of granting a path to the other world.

Dadhīca said:
Having thought this in her mind, the kṣatriya woman went to her house;
and having reached the door of her house, she wept very softly.

Dadhīca said:
Addressed in this manner by the twice-born, she said nothing at all;
she fell to the ground as if swooning, and looked as if she did not see him.

